<title>USA: AMBAC changes name to Ambac Financial.</title>
<headline>AMBAC changes name to Ambac Financial.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Inc. said Friday it changed its name to Ambac Financial Group, Inc., effective at the close of business Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The name change was made to greater reflect the evolution of the company's business,&quot; Phillip Lassiter, Ambac's chairman and chief executive officer, said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company also said it changed the name of its primary operating subsidiary, municipal bond insurer AMBAC Indemnity Corp., to Ambac Assurance Corp.</p>
<p>--Steven Dickson, 212-859-1652</p>
